# {{ name }}

A larsadmin extension with the field `{{ fieldKey }}` and the data card `{{ cardKey }}`.

## Development

Run these from the application root:

```bash
composer config repositories.{{ repository }} path {{ directory }}
composer require {{ name }}:@dev
cd {{ directory }} && npm install && npm run build
```

`npm run dev` rebuilds the extension after every change. Commit the built `dist/` directory, so the application needs no npm.

Use the field and the card in the application:

```php
use {{ namespace }}\Cards\{{ card }};
use {{ namespace }}\Fields\{{ field }};

{{ field }}::make('{{ field }}', '{{ attribute }}'), // in an entity's fields()
{{ card }}::make(),                                  // in a dashboard's or an entity's cards()
```

## Tests

```bash
composer install && vendor/bin/pest   # PHP
npm test                              # Vue components (vitest, jsdom)
```

## Security

An extension's JavaScript runs in the browser with the signed-in administrator's rights. Authorize every record
on the server: use `Larsadmin::findRecord()` in each route you register with `Larsadmin::routes()`.
